    "long_instructions": "**You’re going to write a program to simulate a post going viral—just like you did in class.**\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n- Read the program provided to you.\r\n- Predict what this program will print on Day 2.\r\n\r\n\r\n**🖥️ Coding Tip:**\r\n\r\nRemember that, in Python, `*` means to multiply and `+` means to add. Multiplication always happens before addition.\r\n\r\nAs you read each line of code, try writing down the value of views. Use what you’ve written down to help you calculate what will be printed.",
